WEBVTT

00:00:03.711 --> 00:00:06.604
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Today’s topic is ‘positive thinking’.

00:00:07.275 --> 00:00:13.546
We all know that people who are positive enjoy life more than people who are negative and pessimistic.

00:00:14.276 --> 00:00:18.692
But scientific studies show that positive people are also healthier.

00:00:19.223 --> 00:00:23.181
They get better more quickly when they are ill, and they live longer.

00:00:23.906 --> 00:00:29.604
A recent study has shown that people who are optimistic and think positively live,

00:00:29.605 --> 00:00:33.599
on average, nine years longer than pessimistic people.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:36.631
So, let’s hear what you, the listeners, think.

00:00:37.044 --> 00:00:41.613
Do you have any ideas to help us be more positive in our lives?